{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 56,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "56:1",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "When the Occurrence occurs,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:2",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "There is, at its occurrence, no denial.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:3",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "It will bring down [some] and raise up [others].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:4",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "When the earth is shaken with convulsion",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:5",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "And the mountains are broken down, crumbling",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:6",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "And become dust dispersing,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:7",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "And you become [of] three kinds:",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:8",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "Then the companions of the right - what are the companions of the right?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:9",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "And the companions of the left - what are companions of the left?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:10",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And the forerunners, the forerunners -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:11",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Those are the ones brought near [to Allāh]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:12",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "In the Gardens of Pleasure,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:13",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "A [large] company of the former peoples",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:14",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And a few of the later peoples,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:15",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "On thrones woven [with ornament],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:16",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "Reclining on them, facing each other.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:17",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "There will circulate among them young boys made eternal",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:18",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "With vessels, pitchers and a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:19",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "No headache will they have therefrom, nor will they be intoxicated -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:20",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "And fruit of what they select",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:21",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "And the meat of fowl, from whatever they desire.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:22",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "And [for them are] fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:23",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "The likenesses of pearls well-protected,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:24",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "As reward for what they used to do.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:25",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "They will not hear therein ill speech or commission of sin -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:26",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "Only a saying [of] peace, peace.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:27",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "The companions of the right - what are the companions of the right?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:28",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "[They will be] among lote trees with thorns removed",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:29",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "And [banana] trees layered [with fruit]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:30",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "And shade extended",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:31",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "And water poured out",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:32",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "And fruit, abundant [and varied],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:33",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "Neither limited [to season] nor forbidden,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:34",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "And [upon] beds raised high.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:35",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "Indeed, We have produced them [i.e., the women of Paradise] in a [new] creation",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:36",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "And made them virgins,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:37",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "Devoted [to their husbands] and of equal age,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:38",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "For the companions of the right [who are]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:39",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "A company of the former peoples",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:40",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "And a company of the later peoples.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:41",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:42",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "[They will be] in scorching fire and scalding water",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:43",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 43,
      "text": "And a shade of black smoke,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:44",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 44,
      "text": "Neither cool nor beneficial.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:45",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 45,
      "text": "Indeed they were, before that, indulging in affluence,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:46",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 46,
      "text": "And they used to persist in the great violation,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:47",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 47,
      "text": "And they used to say, \"When we die and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:48",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 48,
      "text": "And our forefathers [as well]?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:49",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 49,
      "text": "Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Indeed, the former and later peoples",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:50",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 50,
      "text": "Are to be gathered together for the appointment of a known Day.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:51",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 51,
      "text": "Then indeed you, O those astray [who are] deniers,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:52",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 52,
      "text": "Will be eating from trees of zaqqūm",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:53",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 53,
      "text": "And filling with it your bellies",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:54",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 54,
      "text": "And drinking on top of it from scalding water",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:55",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 55,
      "text": "And will drink as the drinking of thirsty camels.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:56",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 56,
      "text": "That is their accommodation on the Day of Recompense.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:57",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 57,
      "text": "We have created you, so why do you not believe?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:58",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 58,
      "text": "Have you seen that which you emit?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:59",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 59,
      "text": "Is it you who creates it, or are We the Creator?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:60",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 60,
      "text": "We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:61",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 61,
      "text": "In that We will change your likenesses and produce you in that [form] which you do not know.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:62",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 62,
      "text": "And you have already known the first creation, so will you not remember?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:63",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 63,
      "text": "And have you seen that [seed] which you sow?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:64",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 64,
      "text": "Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:65",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 65,
      "text": "If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:66",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 66,
      "text": "[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:67",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 67,
      "text": "Rather, we have been deprived.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:68",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 68,
      "text": "And have you seen the water that you drink?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:69",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 69,
      "text": "Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:70",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 70,
      "text": "If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:71",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 71,
      "text": "And have you seen the fire that you ignite?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:72",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 72,
      "text": "Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:73",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 73,
      "text": "We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:74",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 74,
      "text": "So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:75",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 75,
      "text": "Then I swear by the setting of the stars,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:76",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 76,
      "text": "And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:77",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 77,
      "text": "Indeed, it is a noble Qur’ān.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:78",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 78,
      "text": "In a Register well-protected;.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:79",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 79,
      "text": "None touch it except the purified [i.e., the angels].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:80",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 80,
      "text": "[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:81",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 81,
      "text": "Then is it to this statement that you are indifferent",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:82",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 82,
      "text": "And make [the thanks for] your provision that you deny [the Provider]?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:83",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 83,
      "text": "Then why, when it [i.e., the soul at death] reaches the throat",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:84",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 84,
      "text": "And you are at that time looking on -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:85",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 85,
      "text": "And We [i.e., Our angels] are nearer to him than you, but you do not see -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:86",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 86,
      "text": "Then why do you not, if you are not to be recompensed,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:87",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 87,
      "text": "Bring it back, if you should be truthful?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:88",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 88,
      "text": "And if he [i.e., the deceased] was of those brought near [to Allāh],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:89",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 89,
      "text": "Then [for him is] rest and bounty and a garden of pleasure.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:90",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 90,
      "text": "And if he was of the companions of the right,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:91",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 91,
      "text": "Then [the angels will say], \"Peace for you; [you are] from the companions of the right.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:92",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 92,
      "text": "But if he was of the deniers [who were] astray,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:93",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 93,
      "text": "Then [for him is] accommodation of scalding water",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:94",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 94,
      "text": "And burning in Hellfire.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:95",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 95,
      "text": "Indeed, this is the true certainty,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "56:96",
      "surahNumber": 56,
      "ayahNumber": 96,
      "text": "So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
